    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "PSA\nFLIGHT SCHEDULE\nNew Smiles to Las\nVegas!\nFrom Los Angeles Long Beach Burbank Ontario\nEFFECTIVE MAY 23, 1979\nINDEX PAGE 2\nSchedule subject to change without notice.",
      "FAIR\nRENT•A-CAR\nSYSTEM\nOF SAN FRANCISCO\n$12.95\n150 FREE\nMILES DAILY\nFLAT RATE\nMAKE\nFiesta 4 speed\n3 Dr. Runabout\nPinto w/air\n$ 9\nNova 2 Dr. w/air\n$11\nNova 4 Dr. w/air\n$12\nFairmont 4Dr. w/air\n$12\nImpala 4 Dr. w/air\n$16\nMonte Carlo w/air\n$16\nT-Bird w/air\n$17\nWagons 9 pass w/air\n$17\nCadillacs 4 Dr.\n$21\nMark V w/moon roof\n$29\nMercedes-Benz 280 SE $35\nMercedes-Benz 450 SL $45\nDAY or WEEK + MILE\n$ 8 $ 50 10¢\nDAY\n$12.95t\n$ 55\n$ 70\n$ 75\n$ 75\n$100\n$100\n$105\n$105\n$135\n$190\n10¢\n$13.95t\n$15.95t\n12¢\n12¢\n16¢\n16¢\n17¢\n17¢\n21¢\n29¢\n35¢\n45¢\n$16.95t\n$16.95t\n$21.95t\n$21.95+\n$23.95+\n$23.95+\n$29.95*\n$39.95*\n*\n+-Flat Rate includes 150 Free Miles Daily\n*- No Flat Rate\n‡-100 Free Miles Daily\nRates subject to change without notice.\nLEASING AVAILABLE\nFREE AIRPORT, HOTEL, MOTEL PICKUP\nAND DELIVERY\nYOU PAY ONLY FOR THE GAS YOU USE\nRATES INCLUDE PROPER INSURANCE.\nWE HONOR ALL MAJOR CREDIT CARDS OR CASH DEPOSIT\nSAN FRANCISCO\n415-391-5485\nTOLL FREE\nRESERVATIONS\n800-634-3476\n180 ELLIS STREET • SAN FRANCISCO\nSAN DIEGO, SAN FRANCISCO, LAS VEGAS, PHOENIX,\nLOS ANGELES, MAUI, NEW ORLEANS",
      "NEW\nFOR\nSAN FRANCISCO\nVLES\nCAR\nRENTAL\nUNLIMITED MILEAGE\nTYPE OF CAR\nSub Compact Stick\nSub Compact Auto\nCompact Auto\nCompact Station Wagon\nIntermediate\nFull Size\n9 Pass. Wagon\nJUN 1 2 1979\nROBERT L. MAY\nWEEKLY |\nDAILY\n68.00\n78.00\n98.00\n110.00\n120.00\n130.00\n140.00\n15.00\n16.00\n21.00\n22.00\n23.00\n24.00\n28.00\nCALL FOR FREE PICK-UP\n342-6898\nDRIVE MORE\nPAY___LESS__\n1555 Bayshore Hwy., Burlingame, Ca."
